  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structures-better-structures-exploration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/271ff0ada6e08acb72ad15fc437dfb238018a77f.jpeg\" alt=\"橫幅\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1421/910/2025-12-11_22-42-37-min-1-png.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgarakrral.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"官方網站\">\n  </a>\n   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.garakrral.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/issues_vector.svg\" alt=\"問題追蹤器\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<h2>關於：</h2>\n<p>Structures 是一個為你的世界增添新結構的數據包！</p>\n<p>新增的結構不僅外觀出色（盡我所能做到最好 :D），還為遊戲增添了深度。與其讓世界充滿隨機且無意義的結構，我們的目標是讓世界感覺更加豐富和身歷其境。</p>\n<h2>注意事項：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structures-modd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">該數據包也已作為模組發布</a>，涵蓋了廣泛的版本。</p>\n<p>該模組仍在積極開發中（並未放棄）。請留意：我可以隨時增刪或修改任何結構的內容！</p>",
